# BUZZBOLT: wave 2's boss, the Bloatfly, can be beaten: homing shots in
# repeating patterns, and gnats called in (worth 100 each). Flown by the
# demo player in the firefly.
game buzzbolt
press A
wait 10
press LEFT
press A
wait 10
cheat lives 3
cheat wave 2
cheat boss
waituntil boss_count == 1 200
expect boss_kind == 5
botuntil boss_dead == 1 9000
expect boss_count == 0
waituntil state == 4 400
waituntil state == 3 400
expect wave == 3
